{"id":30136,"date":"2022-06-07T15:16:11","date_gmt":"2022-06-07T15:16:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.bf\/?post_type=etablissement&#038;p=30136"},"modified":"2026-02-26T15:38:53","modified_gmt":"2026-02-26T15:38:53","slug":"ucad","status":"publish","type":"etablissement","link":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/etablissement\/ucad\/","title":{"rendered":"Universit\u00e9 Cheikh Anta Diop de Dakar (UCAD)"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">L\u2019universit\u00e9 Cheikh-Anta-Diop (UCAD) \u00e9galement connue comme universit\u00e9 de Dakar, est la premi\u00e8re universit\u00e9 de Dakar. Cr\u00e9\u00e9e le 24 f\u00e9vrier 1957, elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 officiellement inaugur\u00e9e le 9 d\u00e9cembre 1959. H\u00e9riti\u00e8re de l&rsquo;\u00c9cole de m\u00e9decine de l&rsquo;AOF &#8211; Afrique-occidentale fran\u00e7aise, elle porte le nom de l&rsquo;historien et anthropologue Cheikh Anta Diop. Son changement de d\u00e9nomination est intervenu le 30 mars 1987.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">L&rsquo;UCAD est compos\u00e9e de six facult\u00e9s, quatre \u00e9coles et douze instituts :<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Liste des facult\u00e9s<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 de sciences et techniques (FST)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 de lettres et sciences humaines (FLSH)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 de sciences juridiques et politique (FSJP)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 de sciences \u00e9conomiques et de gestion (FASEG)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 des sciences et technologies de l&rsquo;\u00e9ducation et de la formation (FASTEF)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facult\u00e9 de m\u00e9decine, de pharmacie et d&rsquo;odonto-stomatologie (FMPOS)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Liste des \u00e9coles<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centre d&rsquo;\u00e9tudes des sciences et techniques de l&rsquo;information (CESTI)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c9cole sup\u00e9rieure polytechnique (ESP)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c9cole des biblioth\u00e9caires, archivistes et documentalistes (EBAD)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00c9cole normale sup\u00e9rieure d&rsquo;enseignement technique et professionnel (ENSETP)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Liste des instituts<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centre de linguistique appliqu\u00e9e de Dakar (CLAD)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Centre d\u2019\u00e9tudes et de recherches sur les \u00e9nergies renouvelables (CERER)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut de formation et de recherche en population, d\u00e9veloppement et sant\u00e9 de la reproduction (IPDSR)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut de fran\u00e7ais pour les \u00e9tudiants \u00e9trangers (IFEE)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut de p\u00e9diatrie sociale (IPS)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut de recherche sur l&rsquo;enseignement de la math\u00e9matique, de la physique et de la technologie (IREMPT)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut de sant\u00e9 et d\u00e9veloppement (ISED)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut des sciences de la Terre (IST)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut des sciences de l&rsquo;environnement (ISE)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut fondamental d&rsquo;Afrique noire (IFAN)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut national des sciences de l\u2019\u00e9ducation physique et sportive (INSEPS)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Institut universitaire de p\u00eache et d\u2019aquaculture (IUPA)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Domaines de formation<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences et technologie<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences Economiques et de Gestion<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lettres, Langues et Art<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences de l\u2019Homme et de la Soci\u00e9t\u00e9<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences de la Sant\u00e9<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences juridiques, politiques et de l\u2019administration<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sciences de l&rsquo;\u00c9ducation et de la Formation<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Dipl\u00f4mes d\u00e9livr\u00e9s \u00e0 l&rsquo;UCAD<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DUT(Dipl\u00f4me universitaire de technologie)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Licence<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Master<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DIC (Dipl\u00f4mes d&rsquo;Ing\u00e9nieur de Conception)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CAES (Certificat d\u2019Aptitude \u00e0 l\u2019Enseignement Secondaire)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Doctorat<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sp\u00e9cialisation<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"author":13,"featured_media":30141,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","format":"standard","back-tax":[],"bourse":[],"domaine":[161,387,312,307,164,333,171,330,371,349,391],"localite":[418],"niveau":[348,347,285,273],"type-etablissement":[290],"type-de-cours":[51,340,21,301],"class_list":{"0":"post-30136","1":"etablissement","2":"type-etablissement","3":"status-publish","4":"format-standard","5":"has-post-thumbnail","7":"domaine-economie","8":"domaine-formation-aux-bibliotheques-a-la-documentation-et-a-larchivisme","9":"domaine-gestion-et-administration","10":"domaine-ingenierie-industries-de-transformation-et-construction","11":"domaine-langues","12":"domaine-lettres-et-arts","13":"domaine-sante","14":"domaine-sante-et-protection-sociales","15":"domaine-sciences-de-leducation","16":"domaine-sociologie-et-etudes-culturelles","17":"domaine-technologie-de-la-protection-de-lenvironnement","18":"localite-dakar","19":"niveau-doctorat","20":"niveau-licence","21":"niveau-master","22":"niveau-master-recherche","23":"type-etablissement-etablissement-public","24":"type-de-cours-formation-continue","25":"type-de-cours-cours-du-jour","26":"type-de-cours-formation-initiale","27":"type-de-cours-formation-professionnelle"},"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/etablissement\/30136","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-jso